<title>FRANCE: Air France adds new flight to Vietnam.</title>
<headline>Air France adds new flight to Vietnam.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France will increase its weekly flights to Hanoi from two to three as from December 15, the French national airline said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Airbus-340s will leave Paris for Hanoi on Tuesdays, Fridays and Sundays with a stopover in Bangkok and return on Mondays, Wednesdays and Saturdays. Air France also has three weekly flights to Ho Chi Minh city.</p>
</text>
